    "raw_main": "\n<div class=\"m1\">\n    <div id=\"content\">\n                    <h1>The Chairman\u2019s Corner</h1>\n            <p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Upcoming API Events and Information:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fall Fun Shoot, Oct 2nd &#8211; <a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2026-API-Fall-Fun-Shoot-Poster_V1.pdf\">Flyer</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/pay-online/fall-fun-shoot/\">Registration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/adopt-a-highway-2/\">Adopt-A-Highway</a> &#8211; 2nd Saturday of March, June, September, and December</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Californians for Energy &amp; Science</strong> &#8211; <a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Unleash-California-Energy.pdf\">Unleash California Energy</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Feel free to reach out to our 2026 API Chairman, John Chafin at <a href=\"mailto:jchafin@calcoastacidizing.com\">jchafin@calcoastacidizing.com</a> or <a href=\"mailto:apibakersfieldchapter@gmail.com\">apibakersfieldchapter@gmail.com</a> or call 661.343.7900.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n            </div>\n                                <aside id=\"sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"message-box\">\n                                    <div class=\"tab-box\">\n                                                    <div class=\"photo\">\n                                <img width=\"118\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-118x125.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail_118x125 size-thumbnail_118x125\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />                            </div>\n                                                <span> <strong><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/chairmans-message/\">A Message From Our Chairman</a> </strong></span>                    </div>\n                                <a href=\"ht