  "chairmans_message": {
    "raw_main": "\n<div class=\"main\">\n            <div class=\"breadcrumbs-box\">\n            <ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n                <li class=\"home\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><a rel=\"v:url\" property=\"v:title\" title=\"Go to EnergyAPI - San Joaquin Valley Chapter.\" href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com\" class=\"home\">Home</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"post post-page\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><a rel=\"v:url\" property=\"v:title\" title=\"Go to About Us.\" href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/about-us/\" class=\"post post-page\">About Us</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"post post-page current-item\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><span property=\"v:title\">Chairman&#8217;s Message</span></span></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    \t\t\t<div class=\"title\"><h1>Chairman&#8217;s Message</h1></div>\t\t<p><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Russell-Thibodeaux-Picture-2-scaled.jpg\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-8975\" src=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-300x201.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-300x201.jpg 300w, https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-1024x688.jpg 1024w, https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-768x516.jpg 768w, https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-1536x1032.jpg 1536w, https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/IMG_6699-2048x1375.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n<p>Welcome API Members and Visitors,</p>\n<p>The San Joaquin Valley chapter of the American Petroleum Industry is the place to be for all those involved in the Oil and Gas industry and all others who are interested in or concerned about our great industry.\u00a0 This membership is comprised of operators, contractors, policy makers, advisors, educators and others who genuinely care about the health of this industry and the benefits it brings to our local economy.\u00a0 Our goal is to foster a spirit of cooperation by promoting an exchange of ideas among members, advocating for a more correct understanding of the local economic support our industry provides and to create a forum for learning and discussion of topics relevant to our industry.</p>\n<p>As a member you will have access to monthly general meetings, several great events like golf tournaments and sporting clay shoots, numerous public service opportunities as well as the ability to contribute to the largest scholarship gifting oil and gas organization in California.</p>\n<p>Please join us in our mission to support and defend this amazing industry by becoming a member of this great chapter today.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/pay-online/2015-membership-application/\">Become a member.</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Looking forward to meeting you,</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>John Chafin</p>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:jchafin@calcoastacidizing.com\">jchafi",
    "char_length": 3160
  },
  "about_us": {
    "raw_main": "\n<div class=\"main\">\n            <div class=\"breadcrumbs-box\">\n            <ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n                <li class=\"home\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><a rel=\"v:url\" property=\"v:title\" title=\"Go to EnergyAPI - San Joaquin Valley Chapter.\" href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com\" class=\"home\">Home</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"post post-page current-item\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><span property=\"v:title\">About Us</span></span></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    \t\t\t<div class=\"title\"><h1>About Us</h1></div>\t\t<p>The San Joaquin Valley Chapter of the American Petroleum Institute is a non-profit organization comprised of petroleum related professionals.</p>\n<p>The objective of this organization is to foster a spirit of cooperation among those directly or indirectly engaged in the production of oil or gas by encouraging a free exchange of ideas among members. We strive to create an understanding by the public of the close economic relationship that exists between the petroleum industry and other lines of business and the community. We support local educational and petroleum related vocational training activities, and provide a forum for the discussion of local problems and issues related to the production of oil and gas, or other topics of current interest.</p>\n<p>We are proud to award API Scholarships each year to local students pursuing careers in the petroleum industry, or a closely related field.</p>\n<p>This is not an easy task, so we rely on our various fundraisers, API members, volunteers, and local community support to enable us to realize our goals. We hope that you will join us!</p>\n<p><strong><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Calibri;\">The San Joaquin Valley Chapter of the American Petroleum Institute is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization, Tax ID 95-3086622</span></em></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/API-Constitution.pdf\">Click here</a> to read our constitution.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/SAN-JOAQUIN-VALLEY-CHAPTER-BY-LAWS-Final-01082014.pdf\">Click here</a> to read our bylaws.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t\t        ",
    "char_length": 2166
