  "contact_us": {
    "raw_main": "\n<div class=\"main\">\n            <div class=\"breadcrumbs-box\">\n            <ul class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n                <li class=\"home\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><a rel=\"v:url\" property=\"v:title\" title=\"Go to EnergyAPI - San Joaquin Valley Chapter.\" href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com\" class=\"home\">Home</a></span></li>\n<li class=\"post post-page current-item\"><span typeof=\"v:Breadcrumb\"><span property=\"v:title\">Contact Us</span></span></li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    \t\t\t<div class=\"title\"><h1>Contact Us</h1></div>\t\t<p>To be added to our newsletter, current events, and other important information, please complete the form below to be added.\u00a0 This is great information and you do not want to miss out.</p>\n<p>Use the following contacts to send an e-mail for more details on API-SJV Chapter or check out our Board of Directors list under the &#8220;About Us&#8221; Tab for more Contact Information.</p>\n<p>Comments and Feedback to our Chair: <a href=\"mailto:jchafin@calcoastacidizing.com\"><strong>John Chafin</strong></a></p>\n<p>Guest &amp; Technical Session Speakers: <strong><a href=\"amygalanski@chevron.com\">Amy Galanski</a></strong></p>\n<p>Newsletter &amp; Sponsorship Opportunities:\u00a0 <strong><a href=\"Dtrahan8@slb.com\">Dustin Trahan</a></strong></p>\n<p>API Dinner Reservations: <strong><a href=\"https://www.apibakersfield.com/pay-online/api-monthly-dinner-meeting/\">Online</a></strong></p>\n<p>Membership: <strong><a href=\"mailto:sbender024@gmail.com\">Scott Bender</a></strong></p>\n<p>Check us out on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/apibakersfieldchapter\">Facebook,</a>\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/api-bakersfield-sjv-chapter/\">LinkedIn,</a> \u00a0<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/apibakersfieldsjvchapter?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&amp;igsh=M2M0Y2JmOTAyOA==\">Instagram</a>, or reach out to our Social Media Coordinator: <a href=\"mailto:kaylene.ransom@anacapa.com\">Kaylene Ransom</a></p>\n<p>Website issues or concerns with registration on any event:\u00a0 <a href=\"mailto:dbudy@sentinelpeakresources.com\">David Budy</a></p>\n<p><strong>Mailing address</strong><strong>:</strong><br />\nAPI San Joaquin Chapter<br />\nP.O. Box 1064<br />\nBakersfield, CA \u00a093302</p>\n<p>Tax Id No.:\u00a0 95-3086622</p>\n<p>To contact us or submit your Resume, please complete the INFO REQUEST FORM below:</p>\n\n                <div class='gf_browser_chrome gform_wrapper gform_legacy_markup_wrapper gform-theme--no-framework' data-form-theme='legacy' data-form-index='0' id='gform_wrapper_1' ><style>#gform_wrapper_1[data-form-index=\"0\"].gform-theme{--gf-color-primary: #204ce5;--gf-color-primary-rgb: 32, 76, 229;--gf-color-primary-contrast: #fff;--gf-color-primary-contrast-rgb: 255, 255, 255;--gf-color-primary-darker: #001AB3;--gf-color-primary-lighter: #527EFF;--gf-color-secondary: #fff;--gf-color-secondary-rgb: 255, 255, 255;--gf-color-secondary-contrast: #112337;--gf-color-secondary-contrast-rgb: 17, 35, 55;--gf-color-secondary-darker: #F5F5F5;--gf-color-secondary-lighter: #FFFFFF;",
